{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064305/block/singleImage/3270196/wm/01M7MV0TTJHPFTD7XV6565TD5A.JPG?updatedAt=1794922100\"/><figcaption>柏傲莊兩房2.8萬元獲同區客承租。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>近期整體租賃市況正面，中原地產大圍豪宅圍方柏傲莊分行資深區域營業董事龐耀昌表示，大圍新晉屋苑柏傲莊最新錄得 3 期 8A 座中層 F 室租務成交，單位實用面積約 473 方呎，兩房間隔，議價後以 2.8 萬元獲承租，呎租約 59.2 元。 據了解，新租客為同區客，見屋苑位置方便，單位價錢合理，間隔合用，即承租單位自用。業主於 2026 年以約 1,112 萬元購入單位，現享約 3 厘租金回報。 即睇大圍柏傲莊租盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:45:38.321517+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T03:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T20:57:40.463665+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:38:56.057165+00:00","content_hash":"cd629516eb91deb6df627efb4ac8cfe054d852aef51372e46ee32aa233f89c18","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:45:38.321517+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}